title: $:/plugins/linonetwo/rybbit-analytics/language/en-GB/

Name: Rybbit Analytics
Description: Inject Rybbit analytics tracking script into TiddlyWiki
Configs/Description: Configure the Rybbit analytics integration for this wiki.
Configs/PluginConfigs/Caption: Analytics Settings
Configs/Enabled/Caption: Enable Tracking
Configs/Enabled/Description: Enabled by default. Inject the Rybbit script on page load (requires reload)
Configs/ScriptUrl/Caption: Script URL
Configs/ScriptUrl/Description: Full URL to the Rybbit script.js. The default points to analytics.tidgi.fun and can be shared across multiple tracked sites on the same Rybbit instance.
Configs/SiteId/Caption: Site ID
Configs/SiteId/Description: Hex site ID from your Rybbit dashboard snippet, for example 70f361fe5d31
Configs/SkipPatterns/Caption: Skip Patterns
Configs/SkipPatterns/Description: JSON array of URL path patterns to ignore, e.g. ["/admin/**"]
Configs/NavigationTracking/Caption: TiddlyWiki Navigation Tracking
Configs/NavigationTracking/Description: Fire a pageview + tiddler-open event each time the user navigates to a tiddler. Recommended — more accurate than default SPA tracking.
